	abstract = {The increase in the aging population leads to an increase in age-related disorders such as dementia. Therefore, the cognitive games on mobile application has been developed for the elderly in Vietnam to improve cognition and prevent cognitive function deterioration. Four cognitive training games in BrainTrain app focused on cognitive domains such as Memory, Attention, Language and Math. Besides that, this app was evaluated via feedback from practical testing with 20 seniors aged 58 to 83. Also, the financial analysis viability of the project was presented to generate a business plan. Four main cognitive exercises developed in BrainTrain include Memory Matrix Span, Match Symbols, Word Jumble, and Mental Arithmetic, corresponding to four cognitive domains mentioned above. The results showed that six people (30},
	author = {Thu Ngoc Minh Phan and Hieu Thanh Nguyen and Tri Nguyen Minh Huynh and Tuong Huu Nguyen and Tram Nguyen Yen Tran and Huong Thi Thanh Ha},
