	abstract = {In this study, a non-tensor product B-spline algorithm is applied to the search space of the registration process, and a new method of image non-rigid registration is proposed. The tensor product B-spline is a function defined in the two directions of x and y , while the non-tensor product B-spline S 2 1 Δ mn 2 
