	abstract = {Due to growing population and technological advances, global electricity consumption is increasing. Although CO_2 emissions are projected to plateau or slightly decrease by 2025 due to the adoption of clean energy sources, they are still not decreasing enough to mitigate climate change. The residential sector makes up 25},
